### Solution transfer component

comp-solution-transfer-fill-normal = Trasladas { $amount } unidades de { $owner } a { $target }.
comp-solution-transfer-fill-fully = Llena { $target } hasta el borde moviendo { $amount } fuera de { $owner }.
comp-solution-transfer-transfer-solution = Mueve { $amount } unidades por { $target }.

## Displayed when trying to transfer to a solution, but either the giver is empty or the taker is full

comp-solution-transfer-is-empty = { $target } vacío!
comp-solution-transfer-is-full = { $target } lleno!

## Displayed in change transfer amount verb's name

comp-solution-transfer-verb-custom-amount = Cantidad propia
comp-solution-transfer-verb-amount = { $amount } unidades
comp-solution-transfer-verb-toggle = Cambiar a unidades { $amount }

## Displayed after you successfully change a solution's amount using the BUI

comp-solution-transfer-set-amount = La cantidad a mover se establece en { $amount } unidades.
comp-solution-transfer-set-amount-max = Max: { $amount } unidades
comp-solution-transfer-set-amount-min = Bajo: { $amount } unidades
